---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Eirik Breen, an Oslo-based Linux systems consultant, homelabber, and AI tinkerer.">
  <article class="page about-page">
    <header class="intro">
      <p class="kicker">A little context</p>
      <h1>Linux at work. Rabbit holes after.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I’m a Linux systems consultant in Oslo. Work is mostly Linux, Kubernetes, and the awkward bits nobody wants
        to own. After hours, I follow sidequests. Sometimes they become tools or posts. Sometimes I just stay up too
        late.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="story" aria-labelledby="how-i-work">
      <p class="section-label">How I work</p>
      <h2 id="how-i-work">Make it understandable. Clever can wait.</h2>
      <p>
        Most days I’m somewhere between Linux, Kubernetes, GitOps, secrets, and observability. A lot of it runs in
        PCI-DSS environments, so “probably fine” is not a deployment strategy.
      </p>
      <p>
        I want the next person to understand what I changed and why. If the automation hides the plot, I don’t trust
        it.
      </p>
      <p>
        At home I mess with my homelab, native macOS apps, local models, and coding agents. When something survives
        more than a weekend, I write it up.
      </p>
    </section>

    <aside class="glance" aria-labelledby="at-a-glance">
      <h2 id="at-a-glance">At a glance</h2>
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt>Based</dt>
          <dd>Oslo, Norway</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Day job</dt>
          <dd>Systems consultant</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Default shell</dt>
          <dd>Something with too many aliases</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Current rabbit hole</dt>
          <dd>Useful AI agents</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p>Open to a good technical conversation</p>
    </aside>

    <section class="toolkit" aria-labelledby="toolkit-title">
      <header>
        <p class="section-label">The toolkit</p>
        <h2 id="toolkit-title">Things I reach for.</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="skill-notes">
        <section aria-labelledby="systems-title">
          <p class="note-number">01</p>
          <h3 id="systems-title">Systems</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Linux administration, mostly RHEL</li>
            <li>Kubernetes with K3s and MKS</li>
            <li>PCI-DSS environments</li>
            <li>Splunk and Elastic Stack</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="automation-title">
          <p class="note-number">02</p>
          <h3 id="automation-title">Automation</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>GitOps with Argo CD</li>
            <li>Ansible for repeatable operations</li>
            <li>Vault and OpenBao</li>
            <li>Small tools with narrow jobs</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="ai-title">
          <p class="note-number">03</p>
          <h3 id="ai-title">AI experiments</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Agentic coding workflows</li>
            <li>MCP servers and tool use</li>
            <li>Local and open models</li>
            <li>Fine-tuning for ops tasks</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="elsewhere" aria-labelledby="formal-version">
      <p class="section-label">The formal version</p>
      <h2 id="formal-version">Need dates, roles, and sensible nouns?</h2>
      <p class="elsewhere-links">
        <a href="/resume">Read the CV</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/eirik-breen" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
      </p>
    </aside>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    width: min(100%, 42rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 12vw, 10rem);
  }

  .intro {
    margin-bottom: clamp(7rem, 17vw, 12rem);
  }

  .kicker,
  .section-label,
  .note-number,
  .glance dt {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .kicker,
  .section-label,
  .note-number {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 9ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 10vw, 6.8rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 0.92;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 35rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.2vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .story {
    margin-bottom: clamp(7rem, 17vw, 11rem);
  }

  .story h2,
  .toolkit > header h2,
  .elsewhere h2 {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6.5vw, 3.8rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.03;
  }

  .story > p:not(.section-label) {
    margin: 0 0 1.35rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .story > p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .glance {
    margin-bottom: clamp(7rem, 17vw, 11rem);
    padding-block: 1.75rem;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .glance h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .glance dl {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .glance dl div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(8rem, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-block: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .glance dt,
  .glance dd {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .glance dd {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .glance > p {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .toolkit {
    margin-bottom: clamp(7rem, 17vw, 11rem);
  }

  .toolkit > header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .skill-notes > section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.5rem minmax(7rem, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-block: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .skill-notes > section:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .note-number {
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .skill-notes h3 {
    margin: -0.2rem 0 0;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .skill-notes ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .skill-notes li + li {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .skill-notes li::marker {
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .elsewhere {
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .elsewhere h2 {
    max-width: 15ch;
  }

  .elsewhere-links {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .elsewhere a {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration-line: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.28em;
  }

  .elsewhere a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 36rem) {
    .about-page {
      padding-block: 4rem 7rem;
    }

    .skill-notes > section {
      grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
    }

    .skill-notes ul {
      grid-column: 2;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .glance dl div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
